error[NK2103]: This task's lambda takes `x`, but a task isn't given any arguments.
  --> tests/async_parse_detached_lambda_with_an_argument.nika:5:2
   |
 5 | 	let h = async(detached) fn(x) { 1 }
   |  ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
   |
   = note: `spawn` starts a body without arguments; the body takes what it needs from the code around it.
   = help: Remove the argument list: `spawn fn { … }`. If `x` is a value from here, declare it before the task and use it inside.

